h the Finance  Minister at its helm to find out exactly  what would be the best route forward to  address the economic crises that are  sure to beset the country as a result of  this lockdown just yesterday some  regulatory and fiscal measures were  announced in addition the government has  asked all states to send funds to send  to add money to the bank accounts of  construction workers one of the main  constituents of the daily wage workers  but they're not the only ones and we  would have to wait and see how exactly  the government is going to ensure that  in the minutes to conduct our officials  can still make their way out and in  short says these daily wage workers and  the poorest of the poor in the country  are continuing to get meals and  sustenance during this lockdown thanks  for that Nimisha Joyce well in Delhi
 

